    "description": "Ashes 2063 is a post-apocalyptic total conversion for GZDoom that blends old-school shooter combat with exploration, scavenging, quests, and influences from Fallout and S.T.A.L.K.E.R. The standalone package includes Ashes 2063, Dead Man Walking, Afterglow, and Hard Reset together with GZDoom and Freedoom2.",
    "downloads": {
